// Session-level integration for MIR constant-expression evaluation, MIR optimization
// (-O0 / -O1), and MIR interpretation (T083).
// Wires compiler.interp, compiler.opt, compiler.own_mir_verify, compiler.mir, and
// compiler.verify into CompilerSession.
